<h2>About the Project</h2>
<p>“Tomb Diver” is a level inspired by the “Challenge Tombs” in the Tomb Raider Survivor Trilogy (Crystal Dynamics/ Eidos-Montréal, 2013-2018) which I created as my final project at School4Games. In accordance with the requirements of the final exam this was an individual piece of work.</p>
<p>To create an experience similar to the Challenge Tombs in the Survivor Trilogy I first studied and analyzed the characteristics of the level design of the Tombs in all three titles of the series with special regard to the Challenge Tombs in “Shadow of the Tomb Raider” (the last title of the series, 2018).</p>
<p>The second part of this project was to apply the insights gained from the theoretical analysis to practical level design and make a level which breathes the spirit of the Challenge Tombs.</p>

