        Meta Human Character
      </h3>
      <p>I wanted to create an authentic experience therefore I needed a convincing female action hero. Yet I did not want just to copy Lara Croft therefore I created my own interpretation of an adventurous archaeologist.</p>
      <p>Since I am not a 3D-Character-Artist I made use of Unreal Meta Humans to create the character for the level.</p>
      <p>I learned to use Unreal modeling tools to adjust the adventurer outfit I had found on Sketchfab so it would fit my character.</p>
